      "help_en": "The client token that is used to ensure idempotence. The token must be a globally unique value generated by the caller, such as a UUID, and can be up to 64 characters in length. If a repeated request with the same client token and identical request parameters is sent within 24 hours after the first request succeeds, the system directly returns the consumer ID created by the first request without creating a new consumer. If a repeated request with the same client token but different request parameters is sent, the system returns IdempotentParameterMismatch. If the first request is still being processed, the system returns IdempotentProcessing. If this parameter is not specified, idempotence control is disabled, and the behavior is the same as that of the previous version",
      "help_zh": "幂等标识，由调用方生成全局唯一值（推荐 UUID），长度不超过 64 个字符。首次请求成功后约 24 小时内，携带相同 ClientToken 且请求参数一致的重复请求直接返回首次创建的 consumerId，不重复创建消费者；携带相同 ClientToken 但请求参数不一致时返回 IdempotentParameterMismatch；首次请求仍在处理中时返回 IdempotentProcessing；缺省时不启用幂等控制，行为与现有版本一致",
